# Notes task browser acceptance: source-only proposal

This proposal authors eight real Chromium scenarios and a dedicated configuration. No candidate, syntax checker, browser, product test, build or original application has been executed for this proposal. It changes no active application, shared collector or workflow. The application under test must be the exact eight Notes after-images from the independently reviewed source authority `335d78a02f53174f8c33a0fe918157418a23eceb80d6ba0e02371f0e8aee32f0`, carried by hosted tooling authority `d343b0d499008c858eb283182c2048b6aa1db36f533395111157929652eed32f`. Those identities are checked before any fixture starts.

The earlier hosted Notes run `38903252258`, job `116980427162`, actually passed all 92 groups from the fixed 17-file selection, including 23 new groups and 20 separately counted Joplin helper comparisons. Its complete readable backup is preserved separately. That run did not execute these browser scenarios; it cannot be relabeled as browser evidence.

